{"id": "JAH-SIG-MISSIONL-000001", "slug": "tool-mission-level-verification-engine-signature", "title": "Mission-Level Verification Engine \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Checks whether the combined system has actually met its defined objectives. The Mission-Level Verification Engine answers the hardest question honestly: did we actually achieve the objective? It maps each mission objective to measurable criteria, checks the evidence for each, and issues a verified/not-verified verdict per objective with the evidence cited. Partial success is reported as partial, never rounded up. Capability specification, not a claim of deployment. Capability specification and design target: this database describes what the tool must do, not a claim of implementation or deployment. Defensive and engineering content only \u2014 no weapon-targeting or attack-execution content.", "capabilities": ["Objective-to-criteria mapping", "Evidence checking per criterion", "Per-objective verified/not-verified verdicts", "Partial-success quantification", "Full evidence citation"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Tool overview and capability inventory", "code": "J({tool:TOOL.name,capabilities:TOOL.capabilities,count:TOOL.capabilities.length});assert(TOOL.capabilities.length>=5,'caps');", "verified_output": "{\"tool\":\"Mission-Level Verification Engine\",\"capabilities\":[\"Objective-to-criteria mapping\",\"Evidence checking per criterion\",\"Per-objective verified/not-verified verdicts\",\"Partial-success quantification\",\"Full evidence citation\"],\"count\":5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-darpa-nasa-grade-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Mission-Level Verification Engine Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Result Verification Engine", "Dynamic Strategy Engine", "Reproducibility and Evidence Auditor"], "sibling_edition": "tool-mission-level-verification-engine"}}
